  "goodToKnow": "Die Zuverlässigkeit is reliability, considered a typical German virtue along with Pünktlichkeit. Zuverlässig means reliable: ein zuverlässiger Partner, ein zuverlässiges Auto. It comes from sich verlassen auf (to rely on). Ironically, Deutsche Bahn's long-distance trains have become known for poor punctuality: in 2024 only about 62 percent arrived on time. It has no plural."
